Use the original PHASE-02 limits as acceptance references:

```text
MEDIAN_CPU_RTF <= 1.00

PREFERRED_MEDIAN_CPU_RTF <= 0.50

MAX_PEAK_PROCESS_MEMORY <= 5.0 GiB

PREFERRED_PEAK_PROCESS_MEMORY <= 4.0 GiB
